---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this RESI website handles search, preferences, external links, and basic hosting requests."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Reading and searching</h2>
    <p>
      This website has no analytics scripts, advertising trackers, or embedded data-collection
      forms. Its search runs in your browser; search text is not sent to a search provider.
    </p>
    <p>
      Fonts and portraits are served with the website. The site does not set application cookies. If
      you choose a light or dark theme, your browser stores that preference locally.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      GitHub hosts this website. Loading a page sends GitHub the usual request information,
      such as your IP address, requested URL, and browser information. Basic hosting and operational
      logs may be processed to deliver and maintain the site.{' '}
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        GitHub’s privacy policy
      </a>
      .
    </p>
    <h2>External services</h2>
    <p>
      Research links, mailing-list forms, social pages, and online giving take you to other services
      with their own privacy practices. Mailing-list signup is handled through Google Forms and
      online giving through Every.org. Email links open your email application.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions, write to <a href="mailto:hello@resi.org">hello@resi.org</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
